ncorrupt, demonstrating his virtuous character and renown in the region, while also reflecting the power of the Zhen clan of Zhongshan as prominent local gentry.","jp":"甄逸の子で、文昭甄皇后の兄。甄堯の最も主要な事績は孝廉に推挙されたことであり、これは彼が地方において優れた徳行と名声を博していたことを示すとともに、中山甄氏の地方豪族としての実力を反映している。","kr":"견일의 아들이자 문소견황후의 오라비입니다. 견요의 가장 주된 행적은 효렴에 천거된 것으로, 이는 그가 지방에서 훌륭한 덕행과 명성을 갖추었음을 나타내며, 지방 호족으로서 중산 견씨 가문의 세력을 잘 보여줍니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1038715","remark":"","surname":"甄","surnameTc":"甄","surnameEn":"Zhen","surnameJp":"甄","surnameKr":"견","surnameOther":"","name":"尧","nameTc":"堯","nameEn":"Yao","nameJp":"尭","nameKr":"요","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"甄尧","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"18","force":"22","wise":"55","politics":"55","charm":"62","will":"55","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"23/23/25/23/23/55/50/23","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"8000","battleSoulPoint":"4700","debateSoulPoint":"4000","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"3/3/2/1/4/0/3/0/2/0/2/3/1/2/4/1/2/1/1/0/0/2/2/3","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"57","loyalty":"120","reputation":"16050","evaluate":"1000","title":"","rank":"5","birth":"176","show":"188","death":"210","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1026005","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;5/1;6/1;7/1;13/